      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TATAMAGOUCHE (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 19.95 beating Life Of Luxury. Can make it two on the bounce. MISS STAR LEE (4) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by one length at Northam in a handy 17.61 beating Makutz. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Sure to be thereabouts. BOURNE REAGAN (6) steps out for the first time at this circuit. Comes here a last start placegetter at Mt Gambier in a TG1-4W (23.50). Got the money at her only try from this box. Leading chance. VAPOUR GLOW (2) can feature with the right run.",
